cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Markerless 3D Human Pose from Two Unsynchronized Smartphones
abstract: >-
  Reconstruction of 3D human motion from two ordinary phone cameras, using a
  flash for temporal alignment and a printed checkerboard for geometry, with a
  windowed spatio-temporal bundle adjustment and a synthetic validation
  framework that measures accuracy without recorded footage.
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Yuhyeon
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9354-6445
